Catppuccin Latte (src/themes/catppuccin-latte.json)
---------------------------------------------------

Source:   https://github.com/catppuccin/palette/blob/main/palette.json (colours) and
          https://github.com/catppuccin/catppuccin/blob/main/docs/style-guide.md (roles)
Version:  palette 1.8.0, commit 07d02aa110ef9eb7e7427afca5c73ba9cf7f8ebd; style guide at
          commit d09787dd98ca6fba08af5ef2ae94a7e09f17daca
Licence:  MIT

Mapping:  by the style guide. surface = Base, surface-raised = Mantle, surface-sunken =
          Crust, hairline = Surface 0, border = Overlay 0 (inactive border), text = Text,
          text-muted = Subtext 1, text-disabled = Overlay 1 (subtle), accent = Blue (links,
          tags), accent-text = Base (on accent), focus-ring = Lavender (active border),
          selection = Overlay 2 at 25 % over Base, hover = Surface 0 at 50 % over Mantle,
          active-line = Text at 10 % (cursor line), active-line-gutter = it composited over
          Base, error = Red, warning = Yellow, info = Teal, success = Green. Syntax: keyword
          Mauve, function Blue, constant Peach, attribute Yellow, string Green, tag Pink
          (escape sequences share the role), punctuation and comment Overlay 2. Upstream has
          no scrim or shadow colour; those are Tyto Light's.
Adjusted: nothing.

